## 🔍 Layer 1 Rules

Currently, the Layer 1 engine starts with:

```text
rule_count = 0
```

until:

```text
load_rules()
```

runs during application startup.

Therefore, without rule loading, the proxy will not block Layer 1 matches.

This belongs to the component responsible for `main.py` / application startup.

